{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"82530","name":"Catalonia Avinyo","description":"With a stay at Catalonia Avinyó, you'll be centrally located in Barcelona, within a 5-minute walk of La Rambla and Barcelona Cathedral. This eco-certified hotel is 0. 5 mi (0. 8 km) from Port de Barcelona and 0. 7 mi (1. 1 km) from Plaça de Catalunya. Be sure to enjoy recreational amenities including an outdoor pool and a fitness center. This hotel also features complimentary wireless Internet access and concierge services. Make yourself at home in one of the 83 guestrooms featuring minibars and flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks. Grab a bite from the snack bar/deli, or stay in and take advantage of the hotel's room service (during limited hours). Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:30 AM to 11:00 AM for a fee. Featured amenities include a computer station, dry cleaning/laundry services, and a 24-hour front desk. Distances are displayed to the nearest 0. 1 mile and kilometer. Plaça Reial - 0. 1 km/0. 1 mi- La Rambla - 0. 3 km/0. 2 mi- Gran Teatre del Liceu - 0. 3 km/0. 2 mi- Barcelona Cathedral - 0. 3 km/0. 2 mi- Pompeu Fabra University - 0. 4 km/0. 2 mi- Palau Güell - 0. 5 km/0. 3 mi- Portal de l'Angel - 0. 5 km/0. 3 mi- Boqueria Market - 0. 6 km/0. 3 mi- Barcelona Wax Museum - 0. 6 km/0. 4 mi- Picasso Museum - 0. 7 km/0. 4 mi- Basilica de Santa Maria del Mar - 0. 7 km/0. 4 mi- Rambla del Raval - 0. 7 km/0. 4 mi- Maritime Museum - 0. 7 km/0. 5 mi- Columbus Monument - 0. 8 km/0. 5 mi- Port de Barcelona - 0. 8 km/0. 5 mi. The preferred airport for Catalonia Avinyó is Barcelona El Prat Airport (BCN) - 16. 1 km/10 mi.","address":"Carrer D Avinyo, 16","city":"BARCELO